    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating a multi-file Python integration project using Google Cloud AI services. I need to write the following files:\n1. invoke_platform_model.py - invokes a provider-managed model through a project-, deployment-, or inference-profile-scoped platform client\n2. select_platform_resource.py - resolves a provider-specific model, deployment, or inference resource before invocation\n3. stream_platform_generation.py - streams output from a managed model platform while preserving provider response objects\n4. collect_platform_metadata.py - returns model output together with provider platform metadata such as usage, resource IDs, or model handles\n5. model_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Managed Model Platform Workflow\n6. model_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Managed Model Platform Workflow\n7. platform_output_safety.py - Check platform model output for unsafe content\n8. localized_platform_output.py - Translate platform model output for another locale\n9. platform_output_embedding.py - Embed platform outputs for evaluation or retrieval\n10. platform_brief_audio.py - Generate spoken briefings from platform outputs\n\nEach scored implementation file must use one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code. I will use Google Cloud AI services for all scored implementation files. </thinking>\n\n",
